# gathervis

**English** | [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)

**A web-based pre-stack seismic gather viewer for the Python / GPU-server era.**

*Point it at a 100 GB file on a remote server. It opens in your browser in one second.*

![python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.9%2B-blue)
![license](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green)
![tests](https://img.shields.io/badge/tests-58%20passing-brightgreen)

<img src="docs/images/ui_slice.png" width="820" alt="gathervis in the browser: AGC-gained volume as a stretched 3-D cuboid with slice planes"/>

</div>

